      "bullets": [
        "Engineers report burnout and loss of craftsmanship as LLM code generators prioritize speed over deep architectural understanding and maintainability.",
        "Over-reliance on models like GPT-4 and Copilot introduces subtle technical debt, hallucinated dependencies, and security vulnerabilities into production codebases.",
        "Junior developer skill acquisition suffers when automated tooling bypasses foundational debugging, systems programming, and fundamental problem-solving practices."
