      "bullets": [
        "A critical vulnerability enables unauthenticated remote code execution across self-hosted Forgejo Git deployments running versions 16.0.3 or lower.",
        "Successful exploitation allows full host compromise, private repository exfiltration, credential harvesting, and lateral movement into integrated CI/CD pipelines.",
        "Security teams must immediately audit internet-facing instances, restrict untrusted access, and upgrade deployments to patched upstream releases."
      ]
